-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"43kg"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"清楚な美少女、欠片ほどの邪心も持っていない。今年のヒロイン候補No．1。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「人々を幸せにするための歌を歌いたい」という夢を抱いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女は詩音に憧れと親愛を感じている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"詩音が教室を去ってしまった後も、戻って欲しいと常に心に感じている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10968","sourceWorkId":"14603","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"清楚可怜的美少女，毫无任何邪恶之心。今年的女主角候补No.1。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"怀抱着「想唱让人变得幸福的歌」这样的梦想。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她憧憬着詩音。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"即便詩音离开教室之后，她也想让詩音回来。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「我是为了唱歌而活着。因为我……除了唱歌以外什么都没有」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"13232"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"喜欢的东西","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"13232","value":"荞麦面"},{"label":"特技","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"13232","value":"学会骑自行车了"},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"82 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10968","sourceWorkId":"14603","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"158 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10968","sourceWorkId":"14603","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"80 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10968","sourceWorkId":"14603","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"56 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10968","sourceWorkId":"14603","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"体重（本版本）","value":"43 kg","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10968","sourceWorkId":"14603","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4e/4e9f633c9d208391ece14e43a8128d42d464873230409055f415767ee36c2417.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6c/6c4ca41d497799f15a5c5ef6d5105e58d44e068f68d788de58016c63f6353708.we